    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/a2f92be6d25930c11db8fb402922462b.avif?t=1750504650\" width=584 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/bd2f4239e27a5294a8388d43f92d2e22.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/9d76c6c745b00f2b86d6e647b258a8a3.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/9d76c6c745b00f2b86d6e647b258a8a3.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Engage in <strong>Local 2-player coop</strong> gameplay where teamwork and communication are key to overcoming the game's obstacles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/c2a340a6e67b08261d9aba80634caf0f.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/31ce10b6457e069e6f829a67a9e51a4b.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/31ce10b6457e069e6f829a67a9e51a4b.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dive into the role of Calla or Eris, tackling unique challenges and puzzles on your own in a beautifully crafted single-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/7630a960c4ed4366e6aa5be89625a131.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/976671affd2d29edff2cb2c3d51165fe.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/976671affd2d29edff2cb2c3d51165fe.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Take on the hero's quest to find and save the lost sheep of your village, each uniquely adorable and awaiting rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/51ec3a498cae59fa9e86899cf6012a4a.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/ffaff6e1c760f7f3e79b210100d46384.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/ffaff6e1c760f7f3e79b210100d46384.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Strategically navigate through fiery landscapes, using tools and clever thinking to manage and extinguish flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/73b29d8838528bbf6b1621ad198347f2.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/4958cbcf3de8da0abaf20f77398dc62a.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/4958cbcf3de8da0abaf20f77398dc62a.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Laugh along with playful physics and ragdoll effects that turn every challenge into a joyful blunder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/25b0d93dcd4bb4009d73006043a83665.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2-player local coop / solo modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minigames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engaging story with cinematics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fun Physics and Ragdolls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve puzzles to Save Sheep from danger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flammable and Extinguishable world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hidden Horse Collectables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard and Controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultra-wide support</p>",
