s=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/73b29d8838528bbf6b1621ad198347f2.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/4958cbcf3de8da0abaf20f77398dc62a.poster.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/4958cbcf3de8da0abaf20f77398dc62a.webm?t=1750504650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Laugh along with playful physics and ragdoll effects that turn every challenge into a joyful blunder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930170/extras/25b0d93dcd4bb4009d73006043a83665.avif?t=1750504650\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2-player local coop / solo modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minigames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engaging story with cinematics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fun Physics and Ragdolls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve puzzles to Save Sheep from danger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flammable and Extinguishable world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hidden Horse Collectables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keyboard and Controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultra-wide support</p>",
